        <div class="contenedor">
          <img loading="lazy" src="/images/1489596.png" alt="protection" />
          <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, store, share, and protect your personal information when you visit or use our website. Protecting your data is fundamental to us, and we comply with all applicable data protection regulations.
          </p>
          
          <h2>Data Controller Identity</h2>
          <p>
            The data controller is <strong>PaparcApp</strong>, located at <strong>Plaza de la Milagrosa 123, Málaga, Spain</strong>. Contact email: <strong>paparcapp@gmail.com</strong>
          </p>

          <h2>Types of Data We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            We may collect different types of information, both directly and indirectly:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Identification data: name, surname, email address, phone number.
            </li>
            <li>
              Browsing data: IP address, browser, operating system, pages visited, time spent.
            </li>
            <li>
              Data provided in forms: messages, inquiries, newsletter subscriptions.
            </li>
            <li>
              Usage data: preferences, browsing habits, interests based on site interaction.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Purpose of Data Processing</h2>
          <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Manage the operation, administration, and security of the website.
            </li>
            <li>
              Respond to inquiries or requests sent through the contact form.
            </li>
            <li>
              Send newsletters or commercial communications, if you have given explicit consent.
            </li>
            <li>
              Analyze trends and site usage to improve our services and content.
            </li>
            <li>
              Comply with legal obligations or requirements from authorities.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
          <p>The legal basis for processing your data may be:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Express consent given by you, for example when subscribing to our newsletter.
            </li>
            <li>
              Execution of a contract or pre-contract when you request services.
            </li>
            <li>Compliance with applicable legal obligations.</li>
            <li>
              Legitimate interest in improving the security and functionality of the website.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Your personal data will be retained only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected, or for the periods required by current legislation. Once these periods have ended, the data will be securely deleted.
          </p>

          <h2>Disclosure and Transfer of Data to Third Parties</h2>
          <p>
            We do not share your personal data with third parties, except when necessary to provide certain services or when there are legal obligations. In such cases, we ensure that any third party complies with legal data protection requirements.
          </p>

          <h2>International Transfers</h2>
          <p>
            If it is necessary to transfer your personal data outside the European Economic Area, appropriate safeguards will be taken to protect your information in accordance with current legislation.
          </p>

          <h2>Security Measures</h2>
          <p>
            We adopt appropriate technical and organizational measures to prevent unauthorized access, alteration, loss, or destruction of personal data. This includes encryption, secure protocols, access controls, and regular security reviews.
          </p>

          <h2>Use of Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            This site uses cookies and similar technologies to enhance your user experience, understand usage patterns, and personalize content. You can modify your browser settings at any time to manage the use of cookies.
          </p>

          <h2>Links to External Sites</h2>
          <p>
            Our website may contain links to external third-party sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites. We recommend reviewing their policies before providing personal information.
          </p>

          <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Our website is not directed to children under 14 years of age. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us to request its deletion.
          </p>

          <h2>Exercising Your Rights</h2>
          <p>As a user, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Request access to your personal data and obtain information about its processing.
            </li>
            <li>
              Request the rectification of inaccurate or incomplete data.
            </li>
            <li>
              Request the deletion of your data when it is no longer necessary or you withdraw your consent.
            </li>
            <li>
              Request the restriction of the processing of your data in certain circumstances.
            </li>
            <li>
              Object to the processing of your data for reasons related to your particular situation.
            </li>
            <li>
              Request the portability of your data to another controller when technically possible.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise these rights, you can send a request to our contact email (paparcapp@gmail.com), attaching a copy of your ID to verify your identity.
          </p>

          <h2>Changes to the Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy at any time, whether due to internal changes or legal requirements. We will inform you of the most relevant changes on the website itself and recommend that you periodically review this section.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we manage your personal data, you can contact us at <strong>paparcapp@gmail.com</strong> or through the contact form available on the website.
          </p>
